---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base lang="en" title="Privacy Policy — GeoLi" description="How geoli.eu handles personal data under the GDPR.">
  <div class="page">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section__label">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: 30 September 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Controller</h2>
      <p>
        George Lincu, <span class="todo">address as in the Impressum</span><br />
        E-mail: <a href="mailto:george.lincu@gmail.com">george.lincu@gmail.com</a>
      </p>

      <h2>2. Hosting and delivery (Cloudflare)</h2>
      <p>
        This site is hosted and delivered by Cloudflare, Inc. (101 Townsend St, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA).
        When you visit, Cloudflare processes technical data such as your IP address, browser type, requested
        page and time of access in order to deliver the site and protect it against attacks. Legal basis:
        Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate interest in a secure, working website). Cloudflare is certified under the
        EU–US Data Privacy Framework. Details: <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener noreferrer">cloudflare.com/privacypolicy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Analytics (Cloudflare Web Analytics)</h2>
      <p>
        If enabled, this site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics to count page views. It sets <strong>no cookies</strong>,
        does not use local storage, and does not create cross-site profiles. Legal basis: Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Contact form (Web3Forms)</h2>
      <p>
        When you use the contact form, the name, e-mail address and message you enter are sent via the
        form service Web3Forms to my e-mail inbox, solely to answer your enquiry. Legal basis: Art. 6(1)(b)
        GDPR (pre-contractual enquiries) and Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR. Messages are deleted once no longer needed.
        Details: <a href="https://web3forms.com/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer">web3forms.com/privacy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>5. E-mail</h2>
      <p>If you e-mail me directly, your message and address are processed only to handle your request.</p>

      <h2>6. Local storage</h2>
      <p>
        If you switch between the light and dark colour theme, the site remembers your choice in your browser's
        local storage. This is strictly necessary for the function you requested (§ 25(2) No. 2 TDDDG) and never
        leaves your device. No cookies are set for visitors.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Private area (/vault)</h2>
      <p>
        A private area is available only to people I have invited. Sign-in is handled by Cloudflare Zero Trust
        Access (one-time code sent by e-mail, or sign-in with a provider you choose). Cloudflare processes your
        e-mail address and sign-in events and sets a session cookie that is strictly necessary for the sign-in.
        Shared files are stored in Cloudflare R2 object storage. Legal basis: Art. 6(1)(b) and (f) GDPR.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Fonts and external content</h2>
      <p>
        All fonts are hosted on this server — no connection to Google Fonts or other font providers is made.
        Links to LinkedIn are ordinary links; LinkedIn only receives data if you click them.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Your rights</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Access (Art. 15), rectification (Art. 16), erasure (Art. 17) and restriction of processing (Art. 18)</li>
        <li>Data portability (Art. 20) and objection to processing based on legitimate interest (Art. 21)</li>
        <li>Complaint to a data-protection supervisory authority, e.g. <span class="todo">your state authority, e.g. BayLDA for Bavaria</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise any of these, just e-mail me.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
